            { "answer": "nyň", "why": "*-nyň* comes after a vowel. *Merdan* ends in a consonant: *Merdanyň*." }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "explain": "*Merdan* ends in a consonant and its last vowel is *a*: *-yň*."
    },
